group-type="author"><collab>Novartis Pharmaceuticals Corporation</collab></person-group><article-title>Novartis receives FDA approval for Valturna<sup>&#x000ae;</sup>, a single-pill combination of valsartan and aliskiren, to treat high blood pressure</article-title><year>2009</year><month>9</month><day>17</day><comment>Available from: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.pharma.us.novartis.com/newsroom/press-release.jsp?PRID=2261">http://www.pharma.us.novartis.com/newsroom/press-release.jsp?PRID=2261</ext-link> Accessed Apr 24, 2010.</comment></element-citation></ref><ref id="b15-ibpc-3-091"><label>15.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Oparil</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Weber</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Angiotensin receptor blocker and dihydropyridine calcium channel blocker combinations: an emerging strategy in hypertension therapy</article-title><source>Postgrad Med</source><year>2009</year><volume>121</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>25</fpage><lpage>39</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19332960</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b16-ibpc-3-091"><label>16.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Law</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>Wald</surname><given-names>NJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Morris</surname><given-names>JK</given-names></name><name><surname>Jordan</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Value of low dose combination treatment with blood pressure lowering drugs: analysis of 354 randomised trials</article-title><source>BMJ</source><year>2003</year><volume>326</volume><issue>7404</issue><fpage>1427</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12829555</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b17-ibpc-3-091"><label>17.</label><element-citation publication-type